ditionalProperties\":false},\"type\":{\"enum\":[\"FF\",\"FS\",\"SS\"]}},\"required\":[\"kind\",\"predecessor\",\"successor\",\"type\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},{\"type\":\"object\",\"description\":\"Put every sibling group in the order its bars start.\",\"properties\":{\"kind\":{\"const\":\"arrangeBySchedule\"}},\"required\":[\"kind\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},{\"type\":\"object\",\"description\":\"Name who does one step on every leaf under a work item (the item itself when it is a leaf), or null to unassign them all. One undo restores each leaf’s previous assignee. Team labels and claims are not read. Refused unknown_step and unknown_person as for setAssignee.\",\"properties\":{\"kind\":{\"const\":\"assignSubtree\"},\"stepId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"personId\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"type\":\"string\"},{\"type\":\"null\"}]},\"personRef\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"workItemId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"workItemRef\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"kind\",\"stepId\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},{\"type\":\"object\",\"description\":\"Claim steps of a leaf, or a whole subtree of a non-leaf, for a person so nobody else picks them up. steps are step ids; absent claims every step not done. runId is the agent run (at most 256 characters); parentClaim names the subtree claim this is delegated under. All or none; a claimed step with no progress becomes in_progress; assignments are untouched unless assign is true, which also makes the person the assignee of every step this claim writes (a subtree claim writes no step), undone with the claim; the result lists them as assignedStepIds. The first claim on a leaf holds the leaf’s declared resource demand, or resources [{ resourceId, units }] when given (each at least the declared units; may add a resource), against the project’s stated capacity minus what other leaves’ claims hold; an unstated capacity never refuses; a later claim on a held leaf holds the same units, or raises them to its resources (never below what the leaf holds), acquiring only the difference against the same free units; the last release frees them, and the result lists what was acquired. Repeating a held claim answers alreadyHeld. Refused, first match: person_not_bound, credential_not_for_person, parent_claim_unknown, parent_claim_foreign, parent_claim_not_ancestor, steps_on_subtree, resources_on_subtree, item_done, no_steps, not_startable (blocked, on_hold, blocked_by_proxy), step_done, already_claimed (names holders), below_declared_demand, below_held_occupancy, resources_exhausted (names the resource, asked, free and holders), inside_subtree_claim, overlaps_subtree_claim.\",\"properties\":{\"kind\":{\"const\":\"claimWorkItem\"},\"assign\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"parentClaim\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"personId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"personRef\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"resources\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"resourceId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"units\":{\"type\":\"number\"}},\"required\":[\"resourceId\",\"units\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}},\"runId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"steps\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"workItemId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"workItemRef\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"kind\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},{\"type\":\"object\",\"description\":\"Remove one step’s actual from a work item. Accepts stepNodeId in place of the work-item and step pair.\",\"properties\":{\"kind\":{\"const\":\"clearActual\"},\"stepId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"stepNodeId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"workItemId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"workItemRef\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"kind\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},{\"type\":\"object\",\"description\":\"Remove one step’s estimate from a work item. Accepts stepNodeId in place of the work-item and step pair.\",\"properties\":{\"kind\":{\"const\":\"clearEstimate\"},\"stepId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"stepNodeId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"workItemId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"workItemRef\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"kind\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},{\"type\":\"object\",\"description\":\"Remove one measured figure. Accepts stepNodeId in place of the work-item and step pair.\",\"properties\":{\"kind\":{\"const\":\"clearMeasure\"},\"metric\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"stepId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"stepNodeId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"workItemId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"workItemRef\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"kind\",\"metric\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},{\"type\":\"object\",\"description\":\"Take a step back to not started. Accepts stepNodeId in place of the work-item and step pair.\",\"properties\":{\"kind\":{\"const\":\"clearProgress\"},\"stepId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"stepNodeId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"workItemId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"workItemRef\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"kind\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},{\"type\":\"object\",\"description\":\"Add a person to the directory.\",\"properties\":{\"kind\":{\"const\":\"createPerson\"},\"name\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"ref\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"teamIds\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"teamRefs\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}},\"required\":[\"kind\",\"name\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},{\"type\":\"object\",\"description\":\"Add a resource to the directory: a host’s RAM, a staging environment, agent slots. resourceKind is exclusive (identical units, demanded one at a time) or divisible (demanded k at a time) and never changes; unitLabel is shown beside every number of it. A name the directory already holds is refused taken.\",\"properties\":{\"kind\":{\"const\":\"createResource\"},\"name\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"resourceKind\":{\"enum\":[\"divisible\",\"exclusive\"]},\"unitLabel\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"ref\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"kind\",\"name\",\"resourceKind\",\"unitLabel\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},{\"type\":\"object\",\"description\":\"Add a service to the directory.\",\"properties\":{\"kind\":{\"const\":\"createService\"},\"name\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"ref\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"kind\",\"name\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},{\"type\":\"object\",\"description\":\"Add a tag to the directory.\",\"properties\":{\"kind\":{\"const\":\"createTag\"},\"name\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"ref\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"kind\",\"name\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},{\"type\":\"object\",\"description\":\"Add a team to the directory.\",\"properties\":{\"kind\":{\"const\":\"createTeam\"},\"name\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"ref\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"kind\",\"name\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},{\"type\":\"object\",\"description\":\"Add a work item. `ref` names it for the rest of this batch.\",\"properties\":{\"kind\":{\"const\":\"createWorkItem\"},\"afterId\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"type\":\"string\"},{\"type\":\"null\"}]},\"afterRef\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"name\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"notes\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"parentId\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"type\":\"string\"},{\"type\":\"null\"}]},\"parentRef\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"priority\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"type\":\"number\"},{\"type\":\"null\"}]},\"ref\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"kind\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},{\"type\":\"object\",\"description\":\"Add a work item type to the directory.\",\"properties\":{\"kind\":{\"const\":\"createWorkItemType\"},\"name\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"ref\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"kind\",\"name\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},{\"type\":\"object\",\"description\":\"Remove a person from the directory.\",\"properties\":{\"kind\":{\"const\":\"deletePerson\"},\"cascade\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"personId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"personRef\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"kind\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},{\"type\":\"object\",\"description\":\"Remove a resource from the directory. Refused in_use with the counts of demands, capacities and occupancies naming it unless cascade, which removes them in the same transaction.\",\"properties\":{\"kind\":{\"const\":\"deleteResource\"},\"cascade\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"resourceId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"resourceRef\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"kind\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},{\"type\":\"object\",\"description\":\"Remove a service from the directory.\",\"properties\":{\"kind\":{\"const\":\"deleteService\"},\"cascade\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"serviceId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"serviceRef\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"kind\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},{\"type\":\"object\",\"description\":\"Remove a tag from the directory.\",\"properties\":{\"kind\":{\"const\":\"deleteTag\"},\"cascade\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"tagId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"tagRef\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"kind\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},{\"type\":\"object\",\"description\":\"Remove a team from the directory.\",\"properties\":{\"kind\":{\"const\":\"deleteTeam\"},\"cascade\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"teamId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"teamRef\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"kind\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},{\"type\":\"object\",\"description\":\"Remove a work item. A parent needs a strategy: cascade its children or promote them. Deleting the only child hands its claims back up to the parent; refused children_claimed (names holders) when claims sit on more than one deleted row or on that parent too.\",\"properties\":{\"kind\":{\"const\":\"deleteWorkItem\"},\"strategy\":{\"enum\":[\"cascade\",\"promote\"]},\"workItemId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"workItemRef\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"kind\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},{\"type\":\"object\",\"description\":\"Remove a work item type from the directory.\",\"properties\":{\"kind\":{\"const\":\"deleteWorkItemType\"},\"cascade\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"typeId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"typeRef\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"kind\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},{\"