null\"}]},\"resourceId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"resourceRef\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"kind\",\"units\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},{\"type\":\"object\",\"description\":\"Set a work item status; on a parent it acts on the leaves beneath. done marks every step done (on = the day it finished, YYYY-MM-DD, absent means today; factStart fills an empty fact start). unknown takes every statement, readiness and hold back and clears both facts of a row that read done. ready/draft set readiness (refused readiness_after_progress once a step has spoken). on_hold/blocked set a hold (refused cannot_hold_done on a done row); on_hold takes the work out of the schedule. in_progress starts the first silent step (on a parent, one leaf), or reopens a done row. blocked_by_proxy is derived and cannot be set.\",\"properties\":{\"kind\":{\"const\":\"setStatus\"},\"status\":{\"enum\":[\"blocked\",\"done\",\"draft\",\"in_progress\",\"on_hold\",\"ready\",\"unknown\"]},\"factStart\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"on\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"workItemId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"workItemRef\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"kind\",\"status\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},{\"type\":\"object\",\"description\":\"Start the next attempt at one step node, numbered its highest plus one. at is epoch ms, absent means now. Refused node_done on a node stated done, attempt_running while one runs, attempt_in_future after now. reference is a URL or label. Accepts stepNodeId in place of the work-item and step pair.\",\"properties\":{\"kind\":{\"const\":\"startAttempt\"},\"at\":{\"type\":\"number\"},\"executorPersonId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"note\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"reference\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"stepId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"stepNodeId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"workItemId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"workItemRef\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"kind\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},{\"type\":\"object\",\"description\":\"Let every number follow the tree again.\",\"